        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Jenrick, Fiona Jones\n- Places: Newark, Newark constituency\n- Events: Newark by-election 2014, Fiona Jones's 1997 election, April 2014 suspension\n\nFacts:\n- In 1997, Fiona Jones was elected MP for the town of Newark.\n- In April 2014, the MP for the Newark constituency was suspended.\n- In 2014, the Newark by-election was held after the suspension of the MP for the Newark constituency.\n- Robert Jenrick won the Newark by-election in 2014 for Newark.",
